│                        ││ I build infrastructure — map servers, command-line tools, self-hosted platforms, and the hardware underneath   │
│                        ││ them.                                                                                                          │
│                        ││                                                                                                                │
│                        ││ Five independent projects carry this page: a self-hosted map server sold as a Mapbox alternative, a static Go  │
│                        ││ binary for browserless file transfer, a private LLM and RAG platform on Kubernetes, a secure element board for │
│                        ││ the Raspberry Pi, and a 3D-printing service that prices and fulfils uploaded parts.                            │
